  "description": "MEVMUY crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C105 H111 N10 O39 Tb9. From the CIF bond table, Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb7 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb9 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb8 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 13 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.542-3.991 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.27-114.46°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C105H111N10O39Tb9. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 10 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
